---
import screenImg from '../../assets/screen.png';
---

<header
  class="relative h-screen flex items-center pt-24 overflow-hidden"
  style={`background-image: url('${screenImg.src}'); background-size: cover; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat;`}
  data-purpose="tech-hero"
>
  <!-- Dark overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40 z-0 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-16">
    <h1 class="font-bold text-on-primary leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-6" style="font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 72px);">
      How machines<br />
      <span class="text-white">learn to understand</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-primary/70 mb-10 max-w-md">
      Understanding the physical world requires more than sensing. It requires context.
      Awareness. Continuity. The ability to qualify what is changing and what matters.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a
        href="#understanding"
        class="px-6 sm:px-10 py-4 sm:py-5 bg-white text-black rounded-[10px] font-label-sm text-label-sm hover:bg-white/90 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">explore</span>
        Explore Technology
      </a>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="px-6 sm:px-10 py-4 sm:py-5 border border-on-primary/25 text-on-primary rounded-[10px] font-label-sm text-label-sm hover:bg-on-primary/10 transition-all flex items-center gap-2"
      >
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
        </svg>
        Request Access
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
